The artifact in models/weights.bin contains compiled ternary circuit weights.
It is not an OpenAI Privacy Filter checkpoint.

The trained PII detector uses annotations from NVIDIA's Nemotron-PII
synthetic English dataset (CC BY 4.0).
Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-PII
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Redakt extracted and normalized labeled spans, trained sequence taggers,
and quantized the resulting weights for local inference.
